PNG-SPEC v1.2 HIGH-FIDELITY
Canvas: 2400x1600 px
Background: Transparent
Stroke: 4px, High-Contrast Black
Font: Inter-SemiBold 32px, White

Layers:
  L0: Coordinate Frame
  L1: Manifold Patch
    - Same curved surface as F1 for consistency
  L2: Geodesic Curve
    - Smooth curve γ(t) with 6px stroke, bright blue (#00A0FFFF)
  L3: Velocity Vectors
    - Tangent vectors along γ(t): arrows at t0, t1, t2
  L4: Labels
    - "γ(t)" along curve
    - "dot{γ}(t)" near velocity vectors
  L5: Annotation Overlay
    - Small text: "Geodesic: ∇_{γ̇} γ̇ = 0"

Export:
  PNG (RGBA), sRGB
